{
  "epId": 5616,
  "name": "食谱：泡泡舒芙蕾",
  "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「泡泡舒芙蕾」的制作方法。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/29/326985891/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_7714102133409423209.png",
